        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86711, Warwick Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Warwick Appliance Pull is modern and sleek. It is packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on any 3/4 inch appliance panel be it on a refrigerator, dishwasher, or some other kitchen appliance. The Warwick Refrigerator Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a selection of popular finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Warwick Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86711-specifications.pdf?v=1704262399\"><b>Emtek Warwick Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86711:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86712:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
